stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Suggested
    Suggested --> Submitted
    Submitted --> PendingReview
    Submitted --> PendingPartnerAck
    PendingPartnerAck --> Committed: proof received
    PendingReview --> Committed: human/system approval
    PendingReview --> Refused: proof missing or risk too high
    PendingPartnerAck --> Refused: partner rejection
    Committed --> [*]
    Refused --> [*]
